              "text": "മോഷ്ടിക്കുക (mōṣṭikkuka) is built from the same Sanskrit verb as മോഷണം (mōṣaṇaṁ), muṣ, \"to rob\", whose noun moṣaṇa means \"robbing\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക."
